inging, jumping, and climbing as you navigate through challenging courses, competing against friends or AI opponents in thrilling races and obstacle courses. Customize your monke with unique skins and accessories, and embrace the thrill of the jungle in Monke Extreme!\n\nJoin the discord: https://discord.gg/uRfMyPMCC5", "short_description": "Monke Extreme is a high-octane fan game inspired by Gorilla Tag. Swing, jump, and climb through jungle courses, competing in races and obstacle challenges against friends and AI. Customize your monke and embrace the adrenaline of the jungle!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkeextreme/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SensorGT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkeextreme/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "7259470344150668"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974896_752734886992673_3142390682395407950_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oeSEGJPijjUQ7kNvwEK2Vsb&_nc_oc=AdqqWQDCApCofWAbakCWtsrKm8hAHPfAtsq_xMavXUkjsybFGRZF31kKcIlzjkvF2Gk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3YGFIRXuW0Y29ne_QKHUfJkfC-XrK81bAiOtn2897zfA&oe=69F3689